OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket freezers in Belgium,
OL,4,ASweden and Luxembourg hit by suspected
OL,5,Acyber-attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FMillions of euros worth of food has had
OL,8,Fto be thrown away, according to local
OL,9,Fmedia reports, with one ICA store in
OL,10,FSweden saying temperatures for its
OL,11,Ffreezers had been set to 50 C (122F).
OL,13,FIt is not clear who is behind the
OL,14,Fattack, which follows a similar
OL,15,Fincident last month that affected
OL,16,Fhundreds of French supermarkets.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
